---
description: Author charts with Semiotic's component schemas and rendering guidance
globs: "**/*.tsx,**/*.jsx,**/*.ts"
---

Start with the [chart authoring guide](https://semiotic.nteract.io/api-reference.md).
Check the selected component with `npx -p semiotic semiotic-ai --schema <Component>`
and validate its config with `npx -p semiotic semiotic-ai --doctor`.

When contributing to Semiotic, use [AGENTS.md](https://github.com/nteract/semiotic/blob/main/AGENTS.md)
for the repository workflow and `ai/system-prompt.md` for guidance matching the checkout.
